==Bulgarian==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈnɛɡo/|lang=bɡ}}

===Pronoun===
{{head|bg|pronoun|personal|g=m|g2=n|tr=négo|cat2=personal pronouns}}

# {{non-gloss definition|Full form of the third-person singular masculine pronoun in the accusative case, used as the direct object of a verb}}; [[him#Pronoun|him]].
#: {{usex|Всяка година на рождения ден на Петър родителите му водеха '''него''' и един негов приятел на кино.|lang=bg|translation=Every year on Peter's birthday, his parents took '''him''' and one of his friends out to the cinema.}}
# {{non-gloss definition|The third-person singular masculine pronoun in the prepositional case, used as the object of a preposition}}; [[him#Pronoun|him]].
#: {{usex|Мразя всичко, свързано с '''него'''.|lang=bg|translation=I hate everything to do with '''him'''.}}
# {{non-gloss definition|Full form of the third-person singular neuter pronoun in the accusative case, used as the direct object of a verb}}; [[it#Pronoun|it]].
#: {{usex|През дъждовния сезон реката, минаваща през селото, наводнява '''него''' и близките земи.|lang=bg|translation=During the rainy season, the river that goes through the village floods '''it''' and the adjacent lands.}}
# {{non-gloss definition|The third-person singular neuter pronoun in the prepositional case, used as the object of a preposition}}; [[it#Pronoun|it]].
#: {{usex|Не разбирам цялото писмо, само части от '''него'''.|lang=bg|translation=I don't understand the whole letter, just parts of '''it'''.}}

